  "notes": "Glenway Avenue: the E-W street at y~1640 is labelled only AVENUE on this plate; taken as Glenway from INSTRUCTIONS22 and its 3400-3600 house numbers. Mayfield Avenue: the E-W piece east of Ross (y~670) and its N-S leg x~7342 to Glenway are labelled only AVENUE; MAYFIELD is printed in line with it west of Ross. Carson Avenue: south of Glenway the street (x~7325) runs south then SW, crossing Laclede, and is labelled CARSON further SW; recorded at the Glenway crossing under both Mayfield and Carson. Wells Street: labelled STREET north of Glenway and WELLS south; it jogs at Warsaw (north leg x~8369, south leg x~8460, both recorded as T). North of Glenway it continues NNE as a road to Lehman Road and NE to the plate top (name not printed there). Fairbanks Avenue also jogs at Warsaw (north x~8948, south x~8867). '?' = E-W street labelled only ST. (y~2258) from the NE end of Lasalle to McPherson. Laclede Avenue: the E-W 'AVENUE' at y~2712 taken as the continuation of LACLEDE. Ross Avenue: diagonal labelled only AVENUE, taken as continuation of ROSS printed SW of Glenway. Ross x Mayfield (~6560,675) and Kuhlman x Glenway lie beyond 300 px west and are not recorded. Large spaced lettering (Glen Grove, G.F. Meyer's, J.E. Bell's Glenn Grove, Kurms, etc.) treated as subdivision names."
